ong>Derek H<\/strong><\/em>"}},"column_K9Rcka":{"type":"column","settings":{"star_color":"#00b67a","bg_star_color":"#c8c8c8","star_symbol_color":"#ffffff","stars_rating":5,"title":"Blanket","text":"<p>Wonderful. Love the color<\/p>","author":"<em><strong>Alyssa S<\/strong><\/em>"}},"column_38r9Qg":{"type":"column","settings":{"star_color":"#00b67a","bg_star_color":"#c8c8c8","star_symbol_color":"#ffffff","stars_rating":5,"title":"Amazing","text":"<p>Love the blankets. I bought one for myself and had to buy one for my husband because I love mine to much to share even though it’s big enough for both of us. Definitely have recommended these blankets to family and friends.<\/p>","author":"<em><strong>Author<\/strong><\/em>"}},"column_hmgeLr":{"type":"column","settings":{"star_color":"#00b67a","bg_star_color":"#c8c8c8","star_symbol_color":"#ffffff","stars_rating":5,"title":"5 Stars","text":"<p>These blankets are amazing! I have bought 3 and I don’t think I’ll ever be able to go back to any other kind. They keep me cool at night and I don’t have to fight for my side of the blanket because they’re so big. They’re very soft and feel slightly weighted but probably because of the size.<\/p>","author":"<em><strong>Ramon<\/strong><\/em>"}},"column_yJ3qyE":{"type":"column","settings":{"star_color":"#00b67a","bg_star_color":"#c8c8c8","star_symbol_color":"#ffffff","stars_rating":5,"title":"Awesome","text":"<p>Can't live without it!!!<\/p>","author":"<em><strong>Ricky<\/strong><\/em>"}},"column_er7rUH":{"type":"column","settings":{"star_color":"#00b67a","bg_star_color":"#c8c8c8","star_symbol_color":"#ffffff","stars_rating":5,"title":"Best Blanket Ever","text":"<p>This blanket is so soft! It’s cozy, and it doesn’t get too hot.<\/p>","author":"<em><strong>April J<\/strong><\/em>"}},"column_DjgVLg":{"type":"column","settings":{"star_color":"#00b67a","bg_star_color":"#c8c8c8","star_symbol_color":"#ffffff","stars_rating":5,"title":"Large and Cozy","text":"<p>Amazing quality and the embroidery is very nice and clean. Its actually threaded and stitched rather than just screen printed!<\/p>","author":"<em><strong>Colt G<\/strong><\/em>"}},"column_kY8BXf":{"type":"column","settings":{"star_color":"#00b67a","bg_star_color":"#c8c8c8","star_symbol_color":"#ffffff","stars_rating":5,"title":"Best fuzzy ever","text":"<p>These blankets are the absolute best<\/p>","author":"<em><strong>Jessie P<\/strong><\/em>"}}},"block_order":["column_mpzd3U","column_67jPJ9","column_nfBnNr","column_K9Rcka","column_38r9Qg","column_hmgeLr","column_yJ3qyE","column_er7rUH","column_DjgVLg","column_kY8BXf"],"disabled":true,"settings":{"display_id":false,"visibility":"always-display","color_scheme":"background-1","desktop_content_position":"above","desktop_content_alignment":"center","title":"Our customers speaking","title_highlight_color":"#6d388b","heading_size":"h1","subtitle":"Excellent [rating] <strong>\/ 5<\/strong> [rating_stars]","subheading_rating_text":"<strong>4.8<\/strong>","subheading_mobile_text_size":18,"subheading_desktop_text_size":20,"subheading_font":"body","star_color":"#00b67a","bg_star_color":"#c8c8c8","star_symbol_color":"#ffffff","stars_rating":5,"text":"","cards_border_radius":16,"card_alignment":"center","show_stars":true,"cards_color_scheme":"background-2","type":"slide","autoplay":false,"autoplay_speed":5,"arrows_color_scheme":"inverse","transparent_arrows":true,"dots_color_scheme":"inverse","desktop_full_page":false,"columns_desktop":3,"slider_desktop":true,"per_move_desktop":1,"desktop_spacing":24,"desktop_side_padding":0,"desktop_padding_calc":true,"desktop_adaptive_height":true,"desktop_dots_position":"under","desktop_arrows_position":"sides","slider_mobile":true,"enable_mobile_preview":false,"mobile_adaptive_height":true,"mobile_dots_position":"under","mobile_arrows_position":"under","padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36,"custom_colors_background":"#ffffff","custom_gradient_background":"","custom_colors_text":"#2e2a39","custom_cards_colors_background